{"path":"string/basic_string_view/copy","title":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::copy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>copy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/copy","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies the substring [pos, pos + rcount) to the character array pointed to by dest, where rcount is the smaller of count and size() - pos.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type copy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, size_type count, size_type pos <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies the substring <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> rcount</span></code><code>)</code></span> to the character array pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>, where <code>rcount</code> is the smaller of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> pos</span></code>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">copy</span><span class=\"br0\">(</